   "source": [
    "# CIFAR-10: ANN vs CNN\n",
    "\n",
    "CIFAR-10 contains 60,000 small **colour** images (32x32x3) in 10 classes (50,000 train / 10,000 test).\n",
    "\n",
    "1. A **fully connected ANN** that ignores spatial structure\n",
    "2. A **CNN** with two convolution + pooling blocks\n",
    "\n",
    "The CNN reaches better accuracy with far fewer parameters."
   ]
  }
 ],
